OL,3,AUS warns Madagascar over growing
OL,4,Amilitary ties with Russia
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US has warned Madagascar against
OL,7,Fstrengthening its ties with Russia,
OL,8,Fsaying similar partnerships with
OL,9,Fmilitary-led governments in West Africa
OL,10,Fhave failed to improve security.
OL,12,FUS Africa Command deputy head Lt Gen
OL,13,FJohn Brennan said Madagascar's
OL,14,Fstrategic location in the Indian Ocean
OL,15,Fmade it important to global trade.
OL,17,FHe warned against what he called the
OL,18,F"Sahel model", which he said risked
OL,19,Ffuelling instability across the
OL,20,Fcontinent.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
