OL,3,AUS warns Madagascar over growing
OL,4,Amilitary ties with Russia
OL,5,
OL,6,FMali, Burkina Faso and Niger, all under
OL,7,Fmilitary rule, have reduced ties with
OL,8,Fthe Western partners and turned to
OL,9,FRussia to support their fight against
OL,10,Fjihadist groups.
